        {
          "_key": "b132f4f8c786",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Studying in the UK is a dream for many Nepali students, and one key requirement is proving English language proficiency. The "
        },
        {
          "_key": "c47a7c31d2e6",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "IELTS (International English Language Testing System)"
        },
        {
          "_key": "8cb1fd6ec0b6",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " is the most widely accepted test by UK universities and visa authorities."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "87844c9d20a4",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "6bf498919bb1",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "In this guide, "
        },
        {
          "_key": "4d64fb39df5b",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "Admizz Education"
        },
        {
          "_key": "be2433b70437",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": ", Nepal’s trusted study abroad consultancy, breaks down the "
        },
        {
          "_key": "25110bed7f28",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "IELTS requirements for studying in the UK from Nepal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "3d572024e727",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": ", helping you prepare with clarity and confidence."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "645e3f038aae",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "f69f544fdda7",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Why is IELTS Important for UK Study?"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h4"
    },
    {
      "_key": "958191931961",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "417c6c8ddeca",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "UK universities require international students to demonstrate their English language skills. This ensures you can succeed academically and adapt to life in an English-speaking country. The "
        },
        {
          "_key": "ad5da84e5119",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "IELTS Academic Test"
        },
        {
          "_key": "7560e1c5c444",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " is accepted by all UK universities, the UKVI (UK Visas and Immigration), and professional bodies."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "e4ca37c98567",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "64236cbfc6e8",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Minimum IELTS Score for UK Student Visa (Tier 4 – Student Route)"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h4"
    },
    {
      "_key": "a54a3dbf0774",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "d183a2bdb8ec",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "To apply for a "
        },
        {
          "_key": "b18bfa6ca744",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "UK Student Visa"
        },
        {
          "_key": "dc7efb43bbfe",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": ", you must meet the "
        },
        {
          "_key": "4e0919043040",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "minimum CEFR (Common European Framework of Reference for Languages)"
        },
        {
          "_key": "6093c492a3f1",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " level B2."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "13dee082d147",
      "_type": "rawHtml",
      "html": "<table class=\"has-fixed-layout\"><thead><tr><th><strong>Level</strong></th><th><strong>IELTS Score</strong></th><th><strong>Purpose</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>CEFR B2</td><td>Overall <strong>5.5</strong></td><td>Required for most undergraduate and postgraduate courses</td></tr><tr><td>UKVI Visa (Non-degree Pathway)</td><td><strong>4.0+ in each section</strong></td><td>Required for foundation or pre-sessional English courses</td></tr></tbody></table>"
    },
    {
      "_key": "c8d8162cb144",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "39a12367926d",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "💡 "
        },
        {
          "_key": "3aaea29d961f",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "em"
          ],
          "text": "Note: Some top-tier universities may require higher IELTS scores (e.g., 6.5–7.0)."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "blockquote"
    },
    {
