          "marks": [],
          "text": "1.  Is IELTS mandatory for studying in the UK from Nepal?"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h4"
    },
    {
      "_key": "4e1675426619",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "36211ebb80e4",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Most UK universities require IELTS, but some may accept alternatives like PTE, TOEFL, or MOI. Check with our counselors at Admizz."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "6bdffdf8b7e2",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "2d87a35f08c8",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "2. What is the IELTS score for a UK student visa?"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h4"
    },
    {
      "_key": "9a1ebf48c8a4",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "9cf8639391fb",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "You need a minimum of "
        },
        {
          "_key": "108bae7baa96",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "5.5 overall"
        },
        {
          "_key": "fd2ae9f7e321",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " in IELTS (Academic) for a standard UK Student Visa (CEFR B2 level)."
